## Remarks

The current batch-16 item carriers define the finite jet operator space and a
quotient by an explicitly specified invariant relation subspace. They are
current item files but are not yet listed in the batch-16 page manifest. This
definition uses only their fixed-weight finite complex quotient and basis
interface. It does not claim that the relation space captures every physical
integration-by-parts, equation-of-motion, or field-redefinition equivalence.
